  "steps": [
    "Dry Roast suji until it changes color and becomes lightly brown.",
    "Soak 5-6 dates in hot water for 10 minutes (can take more if you like the halwa sweeter). You can also take a zero calorie sweetner.",
    "Cook the chopped apple in 1 tsp ghee until mushy and blend the apple with some water and dates until you get a purée.",
    "In the same pan, add 1/2 tbsp ghee and chopped nuts along with the roasted suji.",
    "Sauté for 2 mins and add 2 cups of boiling water along with the purée.",
    "Stir fast to avoid lumps and it should be ready in 3-4 minutes!"
